Provenance and attribution
=============================================================================

Qwen3-TTS-ROCm derives from the Qwen3-TTS work of the Alibaba Qwen team:

    Upstream project:  https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-TTS  (Apache-2.0)

This repository is a thin, platform-specific shim that makes the upstream
qwen-tts package run on AMD ROCm 7.14.0 (gfx1151). It contains NO modified
upstream source code: the official qwen-tts package is installed unmodified
from its published artifact, and all model interaction goes through the
official public APIs. A parity test in the test suite proves the upstream
demo runs unmodified on this stack.

Model weights are NOT included in this repository. The Qwen3-TTS model
weights are subject to Alibaba's own Qwen model license, which this project
does not redistribute, relicense, or modify. Downloading and using the
weights means accepting the publisher's terms at the official pages:

    Hugging Face:   https://huggingface.co/Qwen
    ModelScope:     https://modelscope.cn/organization/qwen

Always check the license accompanying each specific checkpoint you download.
The model's outputs are governed by those terms and by Alibaba's acceptable-
use policy, not solely by this repository's Apache-2.0 code license.

Third-party Python dependencies remain under their respective licenses;
they are declared in pyproject.toml and installed unmodified.
